cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this workflow, code, or demonstration dataset, please cite this
  software repository. A version-specific DOI will be added after archival.
title: "Reproducible Analysis of Australian Bird Communities"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Amin"
    given-names: "Rahil Jasminkumar"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6936-5732"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/rahilJamin/aus_avifauna_analyses"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A targets-based R workflow for occurrence cleaning, landscape-metric
  extraction, beta-diversity modelling, regional-convergence analysis, joint
  species-distribution modelling, sensitivity analysis, and a reduced
  demonstration analysis of Australian bird communities.
keywords:
  - biodiversity
  - beta diversity
  - community ecology
  - landscape ecology
  - joint species distribution model
  - reproducible research
  - R
  - targets
